    <title>Vol.005 那天吃着垃圾版麦辣鸡翅，我觉得人生不是越来越好的|新鲜的食材往往只需要简单的调味</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665412b5c59d1e5757eaa6a1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665412b5c59d1e5757eaa6a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 May 2024 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期我们聊聊平时每天都要碰到的吃饭问题：打工人到底应该</span><strong><span>吃点好的</span></strong><span>还是</span><strong><span>吃点快的</span></strong><span>？</span></p><span></span><p><span>总的来说我俩都觉得做平衡很重要！既可以选择点外卖，也可以尝试一下做饭。</span></p><span></span><p><span>做饭的话食材新鲜搭配最简单的方法也不会难吃，因为</span><strong><span>新鲜的食材往往只需要最简单的烹饪方法</span></strong><span>~</span></p><span></span><p><span>我俩也分享了自己的</span><strong><span>拿手/快手菜</span></strong><span>，推荐年轻人不要总点外卖，多尝试一下做饭~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘎嘎</span></strong><span>-擅长“懒人做饭”，擅用厨房剪刀</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>小红书：</span><strong><span>@</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254"><strong><span>嘎嘣脆脆</span></strong></a></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>啵啵</span></strong><span>-擅长中餐和沙拉，实际是麦门信徒</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>小红书：</span><strong><span>@</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5be1740b90bb080001550424" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5be1740b90bb080001550424"><strong><span>爱吃雪糕请举手</span></strong></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>微博：</span><strong><span>@</span></strong><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3002937602" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3002937602"><strong><span>爱吃雪糕请举手</span></strong></a></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>【联系我们】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书同名官方账号：</span><strong><span>@</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/620c52bb000000001000698b" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/620c52bb000000001000698b"><strong><span>嘎啵脆脆</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎想要学习游泳技能的朋友私信小红书：</span><strong><span>@</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254"><strong><span>嘎嘣脆脆</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作请加wx：</span><strong><span>acxgqjs</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>故事树洞请发送邮箱：</span><strong><span>gabocuicui@yeah.net</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="191">03:11</a> 从最近吃麦当劳吃伤了开始聊起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">08:29</a> 吃着改良版的麦辣鸡翅我觉得人生不是越来越好的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">12:05</a> 早餐的选择：粥，鸡蛋，牛奶，还是外卖？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">19:11</a> 苦于上海很难有地方买到很新鲜的肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1758">29:18</a> 在家经常会做的拿手菜：鸡毛菜（嘎）VS沙拉（啵）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2134">35:34</a> 蒜米和厨房剪刀是追求生活品质的懒人必备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2554">42:34</a> 烤鸡翅做法</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiWMvR4ThcflnuWGgfjpjgTpmz_k.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2648">44:08</a> 空气炸锅薯条做法</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsPv3lMzyYFz3ZwV9KBcy-hjI0fO.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2728">45:28</a> 红烧肉做法</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk_sp0PHGWEkPivH684xi_2E0S81.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3016">50:16</a> 推荐上海两家很好吃的兰州拉面：德元和金强</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr4oYvc5NkkmnpJygzpmqjw3ucMT.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3253">54:13</a> 花钱买食材是一分钱一分货</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3383">56:23</a> 很好的厨具和厨房会激励人做饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3478">57:58</a> 卤肉饭做法</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FguWcfitRqEK90XjbSTPkJsJG7Mb.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3748">01:02:28</a> 想做出好吃的饭，前提就是食材要尽量的好一些</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4005">01:06:45</a> 研究营养学和偶尔吃烧烤不矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Love Yourself-Justin Bieber</span></p><span></span><p><span>Yummy-Justin Bieber</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听平台】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、Apple Podcast、蜻蜓FM、网易云、QQ音乐……</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgKzE-JgGubaYkSkqwWLedbjjVhE.m4a" length="68787197" type="audio/mp4"/>
