    <title>Vol.004 听高能量播客，过高能量人生|从克服拖延症聊起</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6649a5a8251bd96e6c49efb4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6649a5a8251bd96e6c49efb4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 May 2024 07:09:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期从拖延症聊起，聊了创作者心态、好老师的标准、事情安排前置、任务拆解等等观点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐大家经常去好的环境里面呆一呆，接触高能量的人和事，珍惜自己的时间和精力！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>嘎嘎-上海最好的游泳老师且是I人</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>小红书：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254"><strong><span>嘎嘣脆脆</span></strong></a></blockquote><span></span><p><span>啵啵-用提醒事项清空大脑的大E人</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>小红书：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5be1740b90bb080001550424" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5be1740b90bb080001550424"><strong><span>爱吃雪糕请举手</span></strong></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>微博：@</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3002937602" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3002937602"><strong><span>爱吃雪糕请举手</span></strong></a></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>【联系我们】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书同名官方账号：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/620c52bb000000001000698b" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/620c52bb000000001000698b"><strong><span>嘎啵脆脆</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎想要学习游泳技能的朋友私信小红书：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254"><strong><span>嘎嘣脆脆</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作请加wx：</span><strong><span>acxgqjs</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>故事树洞请发送邮箱：</span><strong><span>gabocuicui@yeah.net</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> 拖延症的心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">05:17</a> 嘎嘎：昆虫摄影作品</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgzcRGVOUPAEtmXL9E7bBnXEpLcq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqZ-0wW7W4ok8zAxUWYaAu2UIf4v.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmyqT36E5QaiFFOCgddIqY-4BFpU.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoA9ogQP1zmUYq_4gKItatw_rGc7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">09:47</a> 当老师师德是最重要的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> 从别人的眼光里发现自己的特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> 做出高价值，有自己的态度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 利他者：能帮到别人就会很感动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 克服拖延第一步：把事情简化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> 睡前不安排活跃大脑的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 早上十点完成工作：5分钟能做完的事情就立刻去做，5分钟做不完就先做5分钟的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2996">49:56</a> 如何早睡：把每天结束的时间前置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 啵：把大脑的cpu用来处理当下的事情，把琐碎的事情放到提醒事项里，每晚睡前集中处理提醒事项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3238">53:58</a> 拆解任务到很细的程度就会好上手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3592">59:52</a> E/I人社交差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">1:10:00</a> 珍惜自己的时间和能量，多接触高能量的人和事</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Lambert-不得不爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lambert-Young Boss 2.0</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听平台】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、Apple Podcast、蜻蜓FM、网易云、QQ音乐……</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luWzwcI2U-_AtlxECqHbq8_c5ngK.m4a" length="74531753" type="audio/mp4"/>
