pan><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 嘎嘎：地图收藏种草的店，方便查找</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 嘎嘎：淮海路三联书店有卖台版港版书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 嘎嘎：淮海中路无印良品可以看收纳书籍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 嘎嘎推荐：《夜晚的潜水艇》by陈春成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 啵啵推荐作家郑执，作品《生吞》、《仙症》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 嘎嘎：上海慈善商店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 啵啵：故事一：装修</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 嘎嘎：我们不需要获得别人的喜欢，我们只需要获得别人的尊重！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 嘎嘎：讨好型人格可以后天改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 啵啵：故事二：医美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 嘎嘎：直接拒绝的能力可以从陌生人开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 啵啵：讨好型人格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 嘎嘎：《关系的重建》、《非暴力沟通》、《治愈隐形虐待》、《你的敏感就是你的天赋》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 啵啵：嘎嘎的游泳课很会夸人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 嘎嘎：勇往直前，相信自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 嘎嘎：清涧公园，杂色山雀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 嘎嘎：长江三峡的邮轮故事</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【书籍推荐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《夜晚的潜水艇》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《生吞》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《仙症》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《三体》</span></p><span></span><p>