    <title>Vol.002 嘎老师心理咨询室：受控制的小孩要学会“零容忍”|边界感和双十一分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/655781efc9e7cfe025c74be2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">655781efc9e7cfe025c74be2</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Nov 2023 15:08:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>嘎嘎-INFP，人生导师</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>小红书：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254"><strong><span>嘎嘣脆脆</span></strong></a></blockquote><span></span><p><span>啵啵-ENTJ，自我变态</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>小红书：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5be1740b90bb080001550424" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5be1740b90bb080001550424"><strong><span>爱吃雪糕请举手</span></strong></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>微博：@</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3002937602" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3002937602"><strong><span>爱吃雪糕请举手</span></strong></a></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>【联系我们】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书同名官方账号：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/620c52bb000000001000698b" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/620c52bb000000001000698b"><strong><span>嘎啵脆脆</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎想要学习游泳技能的朋友私信小红书：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254"><strong><span>嘎嘣脆脆</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作请加wx：</span><strong><span>acxgqjs</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>故事树洞请发送邮箱：</span><strong><span>gabocuicui@yeah.net</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 闲逛安福路：Funk&amp;Kale by Wages餐厅，免费提供饮用水的阳光粮品面包店，Brandy Melville服装店，多抓鱼书店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq3rGwqTzP2qqf6ZfWtTYh5-pK74.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs4NHGAAHOPwy1DkaNZkupCj4vHJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhq7mHcN14Ju0XybmX9W6KwBoNbw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Funk&amp;Kale by Wages | 啵啵摄 | 摄影器材：iphone13</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvMQATE7c5q4PDAgTJQ6D9Hp3APm.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>多抓鱼书店，猫 | 啵啵摄 | 摄影器材：iphone13</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">6:10</a> 嘎嘎的中秋扬州之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 沙拉秘诀：蔬菜底+洋葱+坚果+蛋白质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> “人和食物的关系就像人和生活的关系”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 嘎嘎的碎花裙往事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 啵啵的黑裙子&amp;婚礼海报往事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 啵啵的崴脚往事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 嘎：培养生活中的“零容忍”，越不忍别人就会一直侵犯你的底线，就和性骚扰一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> 经常“忍”的小孩默认“忍”是一种解决方法，时间久了就有心理创伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> 和伴侣的相处之道：把话说清楚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a>经常受控制的小孩在长大的过程中就会看别人眼色，很能听懂别人的暗示，并希望伴侣能理解自己的暗示</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">1:04:00</a> 被父母精神控制过的人很容易对亲近的人发火，在外面很能忍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">1:05:00</a> 长大后才知道原来真正的爱是没有任何要求的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3990">1:06:30</a> “或许你妈妈对你的爱就是无条件的，但是小孩子不知道，因为她给你的感觉是你必须做得好她才能爱你。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4140">1:09:00</a> “从小父母就是希望我健康快乐，所以我的思维就是什么事情影响我健康我快乐了，那这个事情/人就是不好，我就远离。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4260">1:11:00</a> 心态好的人往往容易超常发挥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4350">1:12:30</a> 如果从小没有建立一个很好的自我，那你就很容易自我攻击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4380">1:13:00</a> 有一个好心态+身体健康，想做任何事情都没有问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4380">1:13:00</a> 自信和心态是两件事，但是忽上忽下的心态会影响表现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4500">1:15:00</a> 酒店丢失洗面奶事件和陪领导喝咖啡事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">1:20:00</a> 嘎嘎对教游泳的看法：没有学不会的学生，只有不会教不用心教的老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4830">1:20:30</a> 每个人的系统自带版本不一样，但系统也是可以自我更新的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4920">1:22:00</a> 和游戏一样，体验很重要而不是通关很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5040">1:24:00</a> 很多人习惯先从自己找原因，尤其是女生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5190">1:26:30</a> 《牧羊少年的奇幻之旅》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5400">1:30:00</a> 大胆表达，对事情”零容忍“，对人判“死刑”，当下做反应，不能让边界太模糊💪</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【博客中提到的食物/书/餐厅推荐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘎嘎推荐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>淘宝店铺东江湖鲜果</span></p><span></span><p><span>德和午餐肉</span></p><span></span><p><span>米其林餐厅Jean Georges</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>啵啵推荐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Mocarose真空保鲜盒</span></p><span></span><p><span>溪木源面膜</span></p><span></span><p><span>Muji睡衣</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lululemon发带</span></p><span></span><p><span>《笔记的方法》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《埃隆·马斯克传》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《中国居民膳食指南（2022）》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Wash-Bon Ivr</span></p><span></span><p><span>Supermarket Flowers-Ed Sheeran</span></p><span></span><p><span>Exile-Taylor Swift/Bon Ivr</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听平台】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、Apple Podcast、蜻蜓FM、网易云、QQ音乐……</span></p>]]></description>
