    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期聊聊去公园呆20分钟就一定会快乐的神奇魔法，保你一出门就心情好~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>嘎嘎-INFP，人生导师</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>小红书：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254"><strong><span>嘎嘣脆脆</span></strong></a></blockquote><span></span><p><span>啵啵-ENTJ，自我变态|</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>小红书：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5be1740b90bb080001550424" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5be1740b90bb080001550424"><strong><span>爱吃雪糕请举手</span></strong></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>微博：@</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/3002937602" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/3002937602"><strong><span>爱吃雪糕请举手</span></strong></a></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>【联系我们】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书同名官方账号：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/620c52bb000000001000698b" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/620c52bb000000001000698b"><strong><span>嘎啵脆脆</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎想要学习游泳技能的朋友私信小红书：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cfe2bf80000000010021254"><strong><span>嘎嘣脆脆</span></strong></a></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作请加wx：</span><strong><span>acxgqjs</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>故事树洞请发送邮箱：</span><strong><span>gabocuicui@yeah.net</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 为什么想聊上海公园&amp;公共空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 嘎：一本图鉴、望远镜就可以开始观鸟了</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 嘎嘎记错了……</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 现代意义的观鸟活动不是起源于美国，而是最早兴起于18世纪的英国。后来迅速走出英国进入欧洲，漂洋过海传到美国、澳大利亚，最后到达亚洲。</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 中国的观鸟活动开展得比较晚，中国香港观鸟会成立于1957年，中国台北野鸟会成立于1973年，中国内地在1996年开始举办群众性观鸟活动。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 公园是城市公共空间的组成部分，社交场所和citywalk的中转站</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 富民路上的法国舅舅家小酒馆CHEZ JOJO，吃完午饭腿着去静安公园</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkq27RpSjEmtMmqPqlJkwXZcSMWW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>延中绿地，夜鹭 | 嘎嘎摄 | 摄影器材：索尼a7m4</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 嘎保鲜食物方法：厨房纸巾+山姆盒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 崴脚/不想清理顽疾：请保洁真香</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 上海世纪公园一圈5km塑胶跑道，很适合跑步和观鸟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 嘎：上海留鸟界数量最多的“四大金刚”——麻雀，白头鹎，珠颈斑鸠，乌鸫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 南京玄武湖公园，唱歌、荧光棒、划船</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 嘎：玄武湖作为皇家阅兵场，最早始于六朝时期，不是明朝～后经朱元璋重金修缮。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frvhbos-GXSokyp-kLR09n4sQ3_o.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>南京玄武湖公园 | 嘎嘎摄 | 摄影器材：iphone</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm4h_R8jhEY4tJzzku6hfQsRfIb5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>南京玄武湖古阅兵台 | 嘎嘎摄 | 摄影器材：iphone</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 啵：明孝陵&amp;紫霞湖，南京有个接亲习俗是路过太平门和富贵山</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqumhfDs9W5ypUeg68Amhn9Xdc_R.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>南京紫霞湖，游泳的大爷 | 啵啵摄 | 摄影器材：iphone视频截图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 嘎：在重庆和三峡没能游到泳，自此以后旅游都带着泳衣</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl1S3cKl01q0R5v7ZfloloqN5kZ9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>重庆江边游泳的人 | 嘎嘎摄 | 摄影器材：理光gr2</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llRmvnSDZ-KPxihFTcLiovhbvTpS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>三峡青石村 | 嘎嘎摄 | 摄影器材：胶片相机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 徐汇滨江公共空间，潮人/艺术馆/遛狗天堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 啵：浦东滨江，晚上喝酒看对岸万国建筑群亮灯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 世博公园放风筝</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lg6_2LUS4BRqmBdxsTeaAkAZpfSq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>中山公园放风筝 | 嘎嘎摄 | 摄影器材：胶片相机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 共青森林公园，“朝而往，暮而归，四时之景不同，而乐亦无穷也”——宋·欧阳修《醉翁亭记》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnEx3yjajiFc4Uckes9hTmS4Ps8E.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>共青森林公园，冬 | 嘎嘎摄 | 摄影器材：理光gr2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 上海的郁金香是对口云南的支援项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 临港天文馆&amp;星空之境海绵公园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 金鸡湖7.4km²＞滴水湖5.56km²</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 嘎：苏州&amp;台湾的诚品书店，逛书店和逛公园都很开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 上海图书馆借书特别方便，还书期可以逼着读书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 多抓鱼-二手书买卖，电子书-微信读书/得到/kindle</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 嘎：能到竹林下，自有春水声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> citywalk路线推荐“淮海中路-武康路-安福路”，巴金故/武康大楼/多抓鱼/三顿半/话梅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 城市公园特点是城市生活与自然交融的地方</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lq82ArjRMkJ4IwUmBo-L3eNVCiwb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>青西郊野公园 | 嘎嘎摄 | 摄影器材：索尼a7m4</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 嘎：绍兴府山公园，公园/菜市场/KTV</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsYw9G-NLi640gwDIlNeaL_64PE1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>绍兴府山公园，KTV | 嘎嘎摄 | 摄影器材：理光gr2</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvG7MRvAo-9-xGhGFfafq3AAF-if.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>绍兴府山公园旁的菜市场 | 嘎嘎摄 | 摄影器材：理光gr2</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【播客中提到的公园推荐】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>静安公园</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>延中绿地</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>世纪公园</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>南京玄武湖公园</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>南京明孝陵&amp;紫霞湖</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>徐汇滨江公园</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>浦东滨江公园（陆家嘴旁滨江绿地）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>世博公园（梅奔下面那个公园）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>中山公园</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>共青森林公园</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>长兴岛郊野公园</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>广富林文化遗址公园</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>临港星空之境海绵公园</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>青西郊野公园</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>绍兴府山公园</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【BGM】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Hollywood-黑裙子</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听平台】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、喜马拉雅、Apple Podcast、蜻蜓FM、网易云、QQ音乐……</span></p>]]></description>
